    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43259" root="لحم" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلَاحِمُ الفَرْجِ</span></b>  (K) <i>The narrow,</i> or <i>strait, parts
of the pudendum muliebre:</i> (TA:) or rather, <i>the
fleshy parts thereof:</i> the sing. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلْحَمَةٌ</span> signifying,
accord. to analogy, <i>a place of much flesh:</i> see
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِطَانٌ</span>.

